  "instance_name": "ableism_infantilization",
  "label": "Concept: Infantilization of people with developmental disabilities",
  "description": "Infantilization is the process of treating individuals with developmental disabilities as if they are children, regardless of their actual age or capabilities. It involves denying their autonomy, competence, and right to engage in adult roles and activities. This concept is central to the meme's intent, as it frames the woman's joyful cooking activity as the only appropriate or 'natural' role for her.",
